<br clear="all" style="page-break-before:always" />

<h2>3.2 Development Strategy, System Architecture & Implementation Plan</h2>
<p>
    An Agile development methodology was employed, executing bi-weekly sprint iterations:
</p>

<div style="text-align: center; margin: 12pt 0; border: 1pt solid black; padding: 10pt; background-color: #ffffff;">
    <p class="noindent" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;">[SYSTEM ARCHITECTURAL FLOW OF SAMARTH BUSINESS PLATFORM]</p>
    <p class="noindent" style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 140%;">
        <strong>Entrepreneur User Input</strong> (Trade, Capital, Loan Requirement)<br>
        ↓<br>
        <strong>Multi-Page Presentation Layer</strong> (`login.html` → `dashboard.html` → `scheme-detail.html`)<br>
        ↓<br>
        <strong>Client-Side Engine</strong> (Scheme Matcher • Adaptive Capital Planner • DPR Compiler • AI Co-Pilot • Khata Ledger)<br>
        ↓<br>
        <strong>Storage & State Layer</strong> (W3C Web Storage `localStorage` — Zero Latency / Offline Resilient)<br>
        ↓<br>
        <strong>Deliverable Outputs</strong> (1-Click Bank DPR PDF • Verified Scheme Applications • Daily Financial Health Metrics)
    </p>
</div>
