<!-- ==================== PAGE 12: 5. BENEFITS & 6. REFERENCES ==================== -->
<br clear="all" style="page-break-before:always" />

<h1>5. BENEFITS AND IMPACT OF THE PROJECT</h1>
<p class="noindent">
    • <strong>Elimination of Middlemen Exploitation:</strong> Saves micro-entrepreneurs ₹5,000.00 to ₹15,000.00 in documentation charges.<br>
    • <strong>Higher Bank Sanction Ratios:</strong> Standardises documentation according to RBI norms, curbing application rejection rates.<br>
    • <strong>Financial Literacy Promotion:</strong> Fosters responsible budgeting for machinery, raw inventory, and liquid reserves.<br>
    • <strong>Grassroots Inclusion:</strong> Accelerates access for women, SC/ST, and artisans under Stand-Up India and PM Vishwakarma.<br>
    • <strong>Zero-Cost Scalability:</strong> Can be deployed without licensing fees across Common Service Centres (CSCs) nationwide.
</p>

